=== judge sample 2 (unparsed verdict) ===
{"design_fit": 4, "test_quality": 3, "maintainability": 4, "doc_fit": 4, "rationale": "Right seam overall: derived `findDistinctBySpecialtiesNameIgnoreCase` overloads in VetRepository keep matching in the repository, and the template switches to Thymeleaf URL syntax so null drops the param. But `normalize()` plus the blank-vs-filter branch in `findPaginated` and `showResourcesVetList` puts the blank-means-absent rule (a PRD-stated behavior) in the controller and duplicates the branch, a fresh Web-controller deviation with no ADR. Tests name behavior well, but several assert interactions — `verify(this.vets, never()).findAll(...)`, and `theBlankSpecialtyFilterShouldBehaveAsNoFilterOnHtml` asserts only status plus verify — implementation detail, and `jsonPath(\"$.vetList[0].id\").value(2)` is a mystery value. Docs are thorough (ADR, NG-9, REQ-VET-003, defect row removed), yet the `Vets` contract row still reads Implements `—`."
